    rdfs:comment "A work of the United States Government, prepared by House staff (the Office of the Historian and the Office of the Clerk) in their official duties: 17 U.S.C. § 105 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/17/105): \"Copyright protection under this title is not available for any work of the United States Government\". The site gives no licence of its own; its Rights and Reproductions page (https://history.house.gov/About/Rights-and-Reproductions/) concerns only images of objects in the House Collection. Used for verification only, so the deck does not depend on this assessment."@en .

